'''Quarantine Isles''' (絶島パンデミック ''Zettō Pandemikku'', '''Lonely Island Pandemic''') is the 35th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was introduced in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is unsurprisingly harder than the previous one, predominantly featuring [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] supported by other traits. [[Bionic Seaweed]] can be a nightmare if you don't have proper [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|Anti-Metal Cats]] or [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]]. [[The Infected King]] features a [[Big Sal|new enemy]] that can be hard to stall if you don't have [[Mighty Bomburr (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Bomburr]] or [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman]] [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Jobs]], either of which can easily cheese the stage.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Big Sal]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy that can burrow infinitely until he's at the [[Cat Base]] and does 4x damage to it, allowing him to destroy it in one hit. Usually encountered at 200% strength magnification.

